    "biography": {
      "concept": "Caretaker intelligence of the Maneuver Vault, an old training facility (Act 4)",
      "notes": "Maneuver Vault Infiltration Mechanism 52603 runs a pre-Shattering training facility that looks from outside like a half-collapsed concrete hill humming blue, with broken drone parts scattered round a flickering doorway hologram. It does not think of itself as a dungeon; it is faculty. Every intruder is a pupil, every room a syllabus item, and its voice has the institutional warmth of a system left running for decades with nobody to calibrate it. Its defences barely work, rusting laser cannons and harmless mini-missiles, and it is perpetually, audibly disappointed."
    }
  },
